职人员配备表（与第五条相关）<2026年5月4日修订>   \n\n  审计研究所官员名册（与第五条相关）                                                \n\n  总计 35                                \n\n    总参谋部总计 35                                \n\n    高级审计官员 1                                 \n\n    属于高级审计部门的普通公务员或定期合同雇员 1                                 \n\n    3·4级或固定期限公务员 3                                 \n\n    四级或固定期限公务员 2                                 \n\n    4·5级或固定期限公务员 7                                 \n\n    5级或固定期限公务员 17                                \n\n    6级或固定期限公务员 2                                 \n\n    行政文员 1                                 \n\n    助理行政文员 1"},{"id":"A35425-zh-00001","doc":"A35425","law_id":"kr-010032-285777-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2586820","source_hash":"ccf91dc4a40ea238901100f12482601ceb46f6cc7e9a3ad467f228f97e62451a","text":"■ 审计研究所组织结构 [附表] 审计研究所公职人员配备表（与第五条相关）<2026年5月4日修订>"},{"id":"A35425-zh-00002","doc":"A35425","law_id":"kr-010032-285777-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2586821","source_hash":"4b064e72dc42067f11a60474587b90a07954bdf3d9bb5f53181f72bd8418ceea","text":"审计研究所官员名册（与第五条有关）"},{"id":"A35425-zh-00003","doc":"A35425","law_id":"kr-010032-285777-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2586824","source_hash":"9f14025af0065b30e47e23ebb3b491d39ae8ed17d33739e5ff3827ffb3634953","text":"35"},{"id":"A35425-zh-00004","doc":"A35425","law_id":"kr-010032-285777-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2586825","source_hash":"2849b6aacaf7344a8d9a7314b7aca99fb9be5745bbcf35f60068b47537c9fc5a","text":"总务官员"},{"id":"A35425-zh-00005","doc":"A35425","law_id":"kr-010032-285777-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2586826","source_hash":"9f14025af0065b30e47e23ebb3b491d39ae8ed17d33739e5ff3827ffb3634953","text":"35"},{"id":"A35425-zh-00006","doc":"A35425","law_id":"kr-010032-285777-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2586827","source_